SUMMARY:HOWAMID — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: HOWARD MIDSTREAM ENERGY PARTNERS LLC (HOWAMID)\nRoadshow: https://
 www.netroadshow.com/events/login/1PeTHmohFAEhMLd2aoMY0EBTNWzlmp0GnYHYp\n\n
 Deal context:\nHoward Midstream Energy Partners\, LLC is bringing a $600 m
 illion Senior Notes offering due 2035 (8.5-year tenor with a 3-year non-ca
 ll period) to market\, rated B1/BB-/BB- by Moody's/S&P/Fitch\, placing thi
 s firmly in high yield territory. Initial price talk is in the 'High 6s\,'
  with pricing expected today (July 22\, 2026) and settlement on July 27\, 
 2026 (T+3). Proceeds will be used primarily to repay outstanding borrowing
 s under the company's revolving credit facility\, with any excess directed
  toward general corporate purposes\; the deal is distributed via 144A/Reg 
 S for life format with TD Securities acting as left lead bookrunner.
